ntribution helps build a stronger and more connected student community.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have concerns, suggestions, or ideas for future activities, we encourage you to reach out to the University Student Council. Your feedback can help us understand the needs of students and improve the programs and services we provide.\\r\\n\\r\\nLet us work together to make this academic year productive, inclusive, and memorable. With teamwork, enthusiasm, and active participation, we can create a campus community where every student feels heard, valued, and supported.\\r\\n\\r\\nWelcome back, everyone! We wish you a successful and fulfilling academic year. 💚\",\"category\":\"usc\",\"label\":\"USC\",\"image\":null,\"is_featured\":1,\"is_university_featured\":1,\"status\":\"published\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-03 14:02:00\",\"scheduled_at\":null,\"review_note\":\"\",\"published_by\":1,\"scheduled_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03 14:06:08\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-03 14:57:18\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"deleted_by\":null},\"images\":[],\"videos\":[{\"id\":2,\"post_id\":52,\"file_path\":\"uploads/posts/video_52_02b7dc3ed9f3492f.mp4\",\"original_name\":\"Genshin Impact 2026-06-01 07-47-18.mp4\",\"media_id\":null,\"mime_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"file_size\":112623146,\"sort_order\":0,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03 14:42:11\"}]}','Saved publication',1,'2026-09-03 14:59:00');
